              "родовий plural",
              "дванадцять гривень",
              "дванадцять книг"
            ],
            [
              "скільки, багато",
              "родовий plural",
              "скільки гривень?",
              "багато книг"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kotak",
          "title": "Ukrainian money in three forms",
          "items": [
            "**Гривня** (*HRIV-nya*) — Ukraine's currency, written **грн** or ₴. One гривня is divided into a hundred **копійок**.",
            "**Одна гривня — дві гривні — п'ять гривень.** These three forms cover every price you'll say.",
            "Prices are often given without the currency word at all: *Скільки коштує? — Сорок п'ять.* Just like \"forty-five\" at any market.",
            "⚠️ Don't quote prices in *рублі* — that's another country's currency, and saying it in Ukraine is more than just a slip."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "sub",
          "text": "Giving a phone number"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Phone numbers are read digit by digit or in pairs. Ukrainian numbers look like **+380** followed by nine digits. If you need it repeated, the lifesaver is: *Повторіть, будь ласка, повільно* (please repeat that slowly)."
        }
      ]
    }
